  "_note": "Functional grouping for the colour-by-function mode. This is a TEACHING classification derived by rule from each structure's own name and the function note in public/brain-atlas/functions.json. It is not an official parcellation and carries no claim about connectivity or measured function. Rules are ordered: the first match wins, so specific rules precede general ones. Anything unmatched falls back to 'other' and is reported as such in the legend, never silently guessed. Auditable with `npm run check:functions`.",
